+## 9. Work with Puppet Master
+
+When `puppet-master` is available and relevant, let it optimize the execution path while this audit retains ownership, consent boundaries, verification, and delivery. Read its full current instructions through the host's skill provider; do not infer them from a catalog entry. Assistant ownership does not require a separate subagent: use useful independent workers and keep tiny dependent work inline, following current user/platform delegation requirements. Token savings never justify handing feasible work to Blake, dropping evidence or quality checks, skipping required read-back, or claiming unobserved installation. Use `creative-workaround-genius` for failed permitted routes and `project-manager-qc` for cross-session/agent coordination or an independent delivery gate when needed; avoid recursive reloads and unnecessary ceremony.
